        "username": "corro",
        "display_name": "Corro the Unsafe"
      },
      "content": "Three rules: each elided input gets its own lifetime; with exactly one input lifetime, outputs get it; with `&self` or `&mut self`, outputs get the lifetime of `self`. Anything else needs annotations.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-16T19:02:00Z",
      "edited_at": null,
      "is_solution": false
